  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Co Ultra is a well-balanced round co-polyester designed for players who want strong spin potential, reliable control and an explosive response. Its smooth round construction provides predictable ball response and good snapback while remaining suitable for hybrid setups. Racketpedia laboratory results supplied by MSV report 90% spin, 85% control and an 85% resilience peak across the available gauge variants. The 1.20 mm version emphasizes response and feel, the 1.25 mm version provides the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "MSV Co Ultra 是一款强调综合平衡的圆形共聚酯球线，适合希望同时获得强旋转、良好控制以及爆发性击球反馈的球员。圆形光滑结构带来稳定、可预测的击球表现，并具备良好的 Snap-back，因此也非常适合作为 Hybrid 混穿中的聚酯线。MSV 提供的 Racketpedia 实验室数据中，各线径版本均达到 90% 旋转、85% 控制以及 85% Resilience Peak。1.20 毫米版本更强调响应和手感；1.25 毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30 毫米则更偏向耐久和稳定。"
  },

